00:40:24.670 --> 00:40:30.000
It's all right Billy, our visitor's a nice man, he doesn't want to hurt us.

00:40:31.720 --> 00:40:32.560
It's all right, Billy.

00:40:41.380 --> 00:40:44.490
Mobile one in position.

00:40:45.000 --> 00:40:45.460
Roger one.

00:40:46.550 --> 00:40:47.790
All mobiles in position, sir.

00:40:48.530 --> 00:40:51.070
All we can do now is wait for the next transmission.

00:40:54.260 --> 00:41:00.000
An alien wants to...

00:41:02.110 --> 00:41:14.740
help. Why else would he transmit on our wave band? Why won't you speak to me? Get a bearing. Why don't

00:41:14.740 --> 00:41:29.800
you tell me who you are? Tell someone. But the devil's jamming that signal. Second UFO recited.

00:41:30.480 --> 00:41:32.000
Moon base, red alert.

00:41:32.720 --> 00:41:34.500
Interceptors, immediate launch.

00:41:49.330 --> 00:41:51.410
Missile firing minus six, decimal four.

00:42:00.640 --> 00:42:02.290
Interception negative.

00:42:02.290 --> 00:42:04.490
UFO proceeding to Earth.

00:42:04.490 --> 00:42:07.780
Red alert, replacement Sky One.

00:42:30.990 --> 00:42:34.970
- Mobile one to control. - Signal vector 138.3.

00:42:34.970 --> 00:42:38.450
- Tell the mobiles to move in. - Yes, sir.

00:43:19.260 --> 00:43:22.120
- Mobile one to control, eight miles from target.

00:45:21.630 --> 00:45:22.240
- What is everything?
